685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-AjQSVLEm\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-EfMbE6lm\">请求达到频控额度并依旧超出请求，则会触发频控惩罚机制，分别是秒级、分钟级、天级</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VTJMA75c\">触发惩罚后，请求都会被限制，需等待惩罚结束后才会恢复。具体规则详见【<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710758159360\" target=\"_blank\">频控限制说明</a> 】</li></ul></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-mcmeTosc\">本方案结合滑动窗口限流器与消息队列消费机制，实现对API接口的QPS精准控制，统计规则采用动态时间窗口（当前请求发起时刻倒推1秒），主要技术特点：</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-Z8XFek07\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-UjciNRXP\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">滑动窗口算法</span>：精确统计任意时刻发起的1秒时间窗口请求量</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-UPYUZF8b\">两级限流控制：消息队列缓冲 + 动态限流器双重保障</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-OADEMH0I\">弹性流量处理：实现流量整形缓冲队列</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HN4Z2daY\">无损精度统计：微秒级时间片切割（可配置）</li></ol><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-76gjbGKd\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KA0OqHfg\">📌 核心设计理念：<strong>通过滑动窗口算法保证统计绝对时间精度，结合消息队列实现流量削峰填谷</strong></p></blockquote><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-guoc0G7F\" id=\"h346b9f0-guoc0G7F\">实践介绍</h1><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-FE6mLKoP\" id=\"h490b8bf-FE6mLKoP\">架构流程图</h2><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-V31k0ck8\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/a46ac39fe89744d89261e9ddb65ead91~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2066008618&amp;x-signature=Y6kNHLHxPzKmbcbQ7D3dmxzf9so%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-kl8VRbSk\"><br></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-BdEqKjPT\" id=\"h490b8bf-BdEqKjPT\">QPS限流器实现</h2><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22go%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%88%86%E7%89%87%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%5Cntype%20TimeSlice%20struct%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20timestamp%20int64%20%2F%2F%20%E7%B2%BE%E7%A1%AE%E5%88%B0%E6%AF%AB%E7%A7%92%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E6%A0%87%E8%AF%86%5Cn%20%20%20%20count%20%20%20%20%20int64%20%2F%2F%20%E8%AF%A5%E6%AF%AB%E7%A7%92%E5%86%85%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E8%AE%A1%E6%95%B0%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E6%BB%91%E5%8A%A8%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E9%99%90%E6%B5%81%E5%99%A8%5Cntype%20SlidingWindowLimiter%20struct%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20windowDuration%20int64%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E6%80%BB%E6%97%B6%E9%95%BF(%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%9A%E6%AF%AB%E7%A7%92)%5Cn%20%20%20%20maxRequests%20%20%20%20int64%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%86%85%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20slices%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%5D*TimeSlice%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%89%87%E9%9B%86%E5%90%88%EF%BC%88%E9%9D%9E%E4%B8%A5%E6%A0%BC%E7%8E%AF%E5%BD%A2%EF%BC%89%5Cn%20%20%20%20currentPos%20%20%20%20%20int%20%20%20%20%20%2F