\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-CXzLhbZo\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-CXzLhbZo\">方案对比</h1><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table data-custom=\"true\" data-id=\"tf39df60-CFVrSGtl\" class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" style=\"width: 883px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse;\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"883px\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-fAqUOqiM\"><col width=\"438\" data-id=\"c06e2b5c-2grAZDqm\" span=\"1\"><col width=\"441\" data-id=\"c484a45a-5YlQ9Cvm\" span=\"1\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-B3FN0bbM\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-jNAS5bD8\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-hrXgHOHu\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hJJoFIpA\">传统方案</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-mGvZpdow\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SnIWhkNJ\">本方案</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-N8t87hE9\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-ZWb26GEQ\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rWxfD1rx\">⚠️ 自然秒窗口导致0.9s超限</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-OztF57O2\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-T50AZYlp\">✅ 精准动态窗口</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-9hr9TKY4\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-8nmORPTK\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kHxfLegK\">⚠️ 突发流量直接拒绝</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-w9XYRvdC\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3cez7Ia2\">✅ 队列平滑过渡</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-tEw59rAR\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"tfdb4f7e-ejtQNVpm\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NxpDaTQI\">⚠️ 硬限流引发业务中断</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t960a29a-jaiaBudl\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HStJWnn0\">✅ 柔性服务降级</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-IngolGUR\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-IngolGUR\">注意事项</h1><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-0nh3eUWH\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-AOlpJ8Kt\"><strong>动态窗口校准</strong>：建议使用NTP时间同步服务，防止服务器间时钟漂移</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WuMQZPX5\"><strong>突发流量处理</strong>：配置缓冲队列大小时需根据业务容忍度设置合理阈值</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-uK5CrdeJ\"><strong>异常熔断</strong>：当连续触发限流阈值时，自动降级非核心功能</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-uWeUJ0l1\"><strong>监控埋点</strong>：需要监控以下关键指标：</li></ol><ul data-id=\"udcdd064-Z2ZWI6QE\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-C2N20qv0\">实际QPS vs 设定QPS</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-fvalgbDN\">限流触发次数</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-UmBaxXUY\">消息队列积压量</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-IMtBJBtU\">API响应成功率</li></ul><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-mkYck781\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-mkYck781\">附录</h1><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-6J738aje\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-d8mv7ErC\">QPS计算公式：<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">实际QPS = (当前时间戳 - 1000ms) 至当前时间戳之间的总请求数</code></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QR8DOl7P\"><strong>动态时间窗口优势</strong>：相较于固定窗口算法，避免在时间窗口临界点出现2N流量爆发，提供更平滑的流量控制能力。</li></ul></div>",
